{"title":"Copperhead","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 19 Snake that attacks with corrode (melee).</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"tag-chip weak\">slash</span> &nbsp; <i>Resists</i> <span class=\"tag-chip resist\">corrode</span><span class=\"tag-chip resist\">crush</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 30% damage and a resistance takes 30% off (the game's own rule).</p>\n      <p class=\"s good\">⭐ Seen as an elite 1 times (3.4% of sightings). Elites have 3× HP, hit 1.4× harder, give 3× XP and 2.5× loot.</p>\n      <p class=\"s\">Special: venomChance: .25 | venomDamage: 8 | venomDurationMs: 4e3</p>\n      \n      <h2>Levels</h2><div class=\"q-picker\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Level\"><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/copperhead-medium\">All levels</a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/copperhead-medium?lv=18\">Lv 18 <span>2</span></a><a class=\"q-chip on\" href=\"#/monster/copperhead-medium?lv=19\">Lv 19 <span>1</span></a></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">The same monster spawns at different levels, and its hitpoints, damage and XP follow its level (the game’s own formula). In the game a monster more than 5 levels above you shows its level as “???”.</p>\n      <div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-table\"><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>HP</th><th>Damage</th><th>XP</th><th>Elite (HP · dmg · XP)</th><th>Seen</th><th>Mostly</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/copperhead-medium?lv=18\" title=\"Pick level 18\"><td><b>18</b></td><td>57</td><td>14.4</td><td>900</td><td class=\"muted\">171 · 20.2 · 2,700</td><td>2</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Antlion%20Pits\">Antlion Pits</a></td></tr><tr class=\"q-row-on\" data-href=\"#/monster/copperhead-medium\" title=\"Show all levels\"><td><b>19</b> <span class=\"muted\">(base)</span></td><td>61</td><td>13</td><td>950</td><td class=\"muted\">183 · 18.2 · 2,850</td><td>1</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Raider%20Camp\">Raider Camp</a></td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"monster\" data-map-id=\"copperhead-medium\" data-map-level=\"19\">Show level 19 on the map</button>\n      \n      <h2>Drops</h2><div class=\"collector-extra collector-monster-drops\"><b>Observed drops</b><div class=\"muted\">No kills of this monster reported yet; 125 looted corpses recorded.</div><div style=\"margin-top:8px\"><b>Normal loot</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"snake-meat\" title=\"Snake Meat - in 70% of 125 looted corpses, 87 recorded drops, 87 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/d15830124444cf29d721.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Snake Meat</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">70% · 87/125</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"snake-fang\" title=\"Snake Fang - in 65% of 125 looted corpses, 81 recorded drops, 122 total, 1–5 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/f1a8cba3a8479382b961.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Snake Fang</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">65% · 81/125</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"snakeskin-knick\" title=\"Snakeskin Knick - in 62% of 125 looted corpses, 78 recorded drops, 147 total, 1–5 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/9728c594370aae49ebbb.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Snakeskin Knick</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">62% · 78/125</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"venom-gland\" title=\"Venom Gland - in 58% of 125 looted corpses, 73 recorded drops, 122 total, 1–3 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/de59cbec471a8d0c3fd8.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Venom Gland</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">58% · 73/125</span></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"chip-row-mo